  - statementId: 11
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: Oh so you've already reached the level that I require to qualify for this exam? Your learning speed is faster than I expected! Before passing you the exam questions, I'll remind you again on the purpose of this test that I have previously mentioned the last time. Your regular targets in this test are not human beings.That’s the reason why you need to regularly take this type of exams. You will be able to learn things that you really need to learn. You really must continue learning diligently in the future. Eventually, the enemies that you have to fight will not be at this level only. Do you understand me?
      condition:
        isEnable: 1
        classRequiremnet:
          brawlerMale: 1
